  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      47.97,
      486.22,
      266.66,
      497.29
    ],
    "text": "1. Extent of the Protection Area is 36.4217 hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      47.97,
      514.22,
      542.5,
      539.29
    ],
    "text": "2. Such Protection Area is situated in Kurukalmadum North Grama Niladhari Division, Manmunai South Eruvilpattu Divisional Secretariat in Batticaloa District in the Eastern Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      47.97,
      556.22,
      304.16,
      567.29
    ],
    "text": "3. The metes and bounds of the Protection Area as follows :-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      47.97,
      578.22,
      542.48,
      617.29
    ],
    "text": "North - Starting from the place mentioned in Global Positioning System (GPS) co-ordinate 584640 E, 839784 N up to the place mentioned in Global Positioning System (GPS) co-ordinate 584809 E, 839849 N along the cart road.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      47.97,
      634.22,
      542.48,
      687.29
    ],
    "text": "East - From the last mentioned place, up to the place mentioned in Global Positioning System (GPS)co-ordinates 585436 E, 838951 N along the Global Positioning System (GPS) co-ordinates 584865 E, 839786 N, 584896 E, 839722 N, 584930 E, 839663 N, 584960 E, 839629 N, 585034 E, 839560 N, 585120 E, 839373 N, 585169 E, 839301 N and 585260 E, 839220 N.",
    "fonts": [
