      47.97,
      704.22,
      539.97,
      729.29
    ],
    "text": "South - From the last mentioned place, up to the place mentioned in Global Positioning System (GPS)co-ordinate 585125 E, 838855 N along the ferry road.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
