      147.13
    ],
    "text": "Part I",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      201.32,
      158.06,
      401.2,
      169.13
    ],
    "text": "Activities permitted within the Protection Area",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      180.06,
      521.38,
      191.13
    ],
    "text": "The physical planning and development within the Protection Area shall be only for the following activities:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      206.06,
      345.15,
      217.13
    ],
    "text": "1. Management and maintenance of existing irrigation scheme.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      224.06,
      320.4,
      235.13
    ],
    "text": "2. Management of alien invasive fauna and \ufb02 ora species.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      242.06,
      174.37,
      253.13
    ],
    "text": "3. Fishing activities.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      260.06,
      263.79,
      271.13
    ],
    "text": "4. Plucking of \ufb02 owers from aquatic plants.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      278.06,
      244.88,
      289.13
    ],
    "text": "5. Educational and research activities.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      296.06,
      396.5,
      307.13
    ],
    "text": "6. Eco-tourism activities (without permanent or semi permanent structures).",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      286.67,
      324.06,
      315.83,
      335.13
    ],
    "text": "Part II",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      118.47,
      348.06,
      484.04,
      373.13
    ],
    "text": "Conditions to be applied in carrying out the activities set out in Part I of this Schedulewithin the Protection Area",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.26,
      386.06,
      549.78,
      411.13
    ],
    "text": "1. Any physical planning and development set out in Part I of this Schedule shall be carried out subject to the following conditions:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.26,
      425.06,
      418.92,
      436.13
    ],
    "text": "(a) motor boats shall not use in \ufb01 shing activities within the Protection Area;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.26,
      455.06,
      549.79,
      481.13
    ],
    "text": "(b) such activities shall be carried out in such a manner as not to disturb the general life pattern of life, the livelihood of the villages and fauna and \ufb02 ora habitats;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.26,
      500.06,
      463.02,
      511.13
    ],
    "text": "(c) alien invasive fauna and \ufb02 ora species shall not be introduced to the Protection Area;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.26,
      530.06,
      494.39,
      541.13
    ],
    "text": "(d) any waste or wastewater of whatever condition shall not be disposed to the Protection Area;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.26,
      560.06,
      549.71,
      586.13
    ],
    "text": "(e) reclamation of land, activities relevant to land degradation and soil erosion shall not be undertaken in the Protection Area.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.26,
      605.06,
      549.79,
      631.13
    ],
    "text": "2. The Authority may, subject to paragraph (j) of section 10 of the Act, appoint a committee to assist the Authority in the performance of its functions relating to the planning and development within the Protection Area.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.26,
      650.06,
      228.31,
      661.13
    ],
    "text": "3. Such committee shall consist of-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.26,
      674.06,
      549.79,
      699.13
    ],
    "text": "(a) the Director of the Eastern Province of the Authority, and the Deputy Commissioner of Batticaloa District of the Department of Agrarian Development, who shall co-chair, the Committee;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.26,
      716.06,
      446.09,
      727.13
    ],
    "text": "(b) the Divisional Secretary of Manmunai South Eruvilpattu Divisional Secretariat;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.26,
      744.06,
      385.84,
      755.13
    ],
